SUMMARY:Yosemite: Tioga Road typically opens
DESCRIPTION:Tioga Road has opened between late April and late July over the
  record\; late May to mid-June is the usual range\, and 2026 opened May 15
 . The park posts plowing progress weekly and announces the opening a day o
 r two ahead. Typical window\, not a published date\; the park announces th
 e day a few days ahead. Source: https://www.nps.gov/yose/planyourvisit/tio
 gaopen.htm. Verified 2026-10-10. The Talus Field\, https://thetalusfieldjo
 urnal.com/dates
